<body class="mizan-shell"><main class="mizan-main" data-audit-workspace><header class="topbar"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="{{ route('dashboard') }}">Workspace</a><b>/</b><strong>Audit runs</strong></div></header><section class="dashboard-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">Reproducible configuration</p><h1>Configure an <em>audit run.</em></h1><p class="intro-copy">Select a versioned source, selected cultural terms, model settings, and PA/PB/PC prompts before freezing the audit.</p></div></section><p class="workspace-message" data-audit-message hidden role="status"></p><section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>Draft audit</h2></div><form class="workspace-form" data-audit-form><label>Project <select name="project_id" data-audit-project required></select></label><label>Document version <select name="document_version_id" data-audit-version required></select></label><label>Audit name <input name="name" required maxlength="255"></label><label>Mode <select name="audit_mode"><option value="PILOT_COMPATIBLE">Pilot compatible</option><option value="PROFESSIONAL_AUDIT">Professional audit</option><option value="REPEATED_RESEARCH">Repeated research</option></select></label><label>Scoring mode <select name="scoring_mode"><option value="MANUSCRIPT_COMPATIBLE">Manuscript compatible</option><option value="VERIFIED_ONLY">Verified only</option><option value="EXPERT_ONLY">Expert only</option><option value="CONSENSUS">Consensus</option></select></label><label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" name="blind_expert_review" checked> Blind expert review</label><button type="submit" class="primary-action">Create draft</button></form></section><section class="panel workspace-section" data-audit-config hidden><div class="panel-heading"><h2>Freeze configuration</h2></div><form class="workspace-form" data-model-form><label>Provider <select name="provider"><option value="MANUAL_IMPORT">Manual import</option><option value="OLLAMA">Ollama (local)</option><option value="OPENAI">OpenAI</option><option value="ANTHROPIC">Anthropic</option><option value="GEMINI">Google Gemini</option></select></label><label>Display name <input name="display_name" required></label><label>Provider model ID <input name="provider_model_id" required></label><label>Execution environment <input name="execution_environment" value="LOCAL" required></label><button class="secondary-action" type="submit">Add model</button></form><div data-audit-terms></div><div data-audit-models></div><div data-audit-prompts></div><button type="button" class="primary-action" data-freeze-audit>Freeze audit</button></section><section class="panel workspace-section"><h2>Audit history</h2><div data-audit-list></div></section><section class="panel workspace-section"><h2>Generation status</h2><div data-generation-list></div></section></main></body></html>
